<title>GERMANY: Buba-bond consortium to meet Jan 7 on 10-year Bund.</title>
<headline>Buba-bond consortium to meet Jan 7 on 10-year Bund.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Friday that the German bond consortium for the new 10-year Bund would meet on Tuesday, January 7, at 1030 GMT.</p>
<p>The central bank said trading of the new bond will start Monday, January 13. The consortium will be able to make offers on the issue until January 8 at 1000 GMT, while the settlement date is scheduled for January 10.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank repeated that the new bond can be &quot;stripped&quot; from July 1997.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
